    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are a master at fighting <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a>.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Martial_Arts_I\" title=\"Martial Arts I\">Martial Arts I</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +3.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Damage dealt by your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a> attacks increases by one die step. In addition, you gain a +1 dodge bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> (Which stacks with the dodge bonus granted by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Martial_Arts_I\" title=\"Martial Arts I\">Martial Arts I</a> Feat).</p><p><b>Special:</b> A situation that makes you lose your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> (If any) also makes you lose any dodge bonuses. Also, dodge bonuses stack with each other, unlike most other types of bonuses.</p>",
